#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:1
msgid "Command-line options reference"
msgstr "命令行参数参考"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:3
msgid ""
"Every command-line option of `cnets` and `cnetml`, with its short form, "
"default value, accepted values and meaning. Defaults and accepted values are"
" taken from the `boost::program_options` definitions in `code/cnets.cpp` and"
" `code/cnetml.cpp`. For an explanation of *why* you would pick one setting "
"over another, see each tool's User guide page ([`cnets`](../user-"
"guide/cnets.md#options), [`cnetml`](../user-guide/cnetml.md#options)). "
"`cnetmcmc` reads most of its settings from a config file; see its [Options"
"](../user-guide/cnetmcmc.md#options)."
msgstr ""
"`cnets` 和 `cnetml` 的全部命令行参数，包括简写、默认值、可选值和含义。默认值和可选值以 `code/cnets.cpp` 与 "
"`code/cnetml.cpp` 中的 `boost::program_options` 定义为准。不同设置之间*如何选择*，见各工具的 User "
"guide 页面（[`cnets`](../user-guide/cnets.md#options)、[`cnetml`](../user-"
"guide/cnetml.md#options)）。`cnetmcmc` 的大部分设置从配置文件读取，见其 [Options](../user-"
"guide/cnetmcmc.md#options)。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:13
msgid ""
"Usage: `bin/cnets --name value` or `bin/cnets -x value`, for example "
"`bin/cnets -o sim/ --nregion 5 --bsr_mode 3 --seed 1`. Run any tool with "
"`--help` to print its full option list."
msgstr ""
"用法：`bin/cnets --参数名 值` 或 `bin/cnets -简写 值`，例如 `bin/cnets -o sim/ --nregion 5"
" --bsr_mode 3 --seed 1`。任一工具加 `--help` 可打印全部参数。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:17
msgid "On/off switches take an integer: `0` = no, `1` = yes."
msgstr "开关类参数用整数表示：`0` = 否，`1` = 是。"

