#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:77
msgid "Branch-specific rates"
msgstr "分支特异速率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--bsr_mode`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Only with `method=0`; with `method=1`, `cnets` stops with an error. 0: one "
"rate on all branches; 1: one shared multiplier per branch (all event "
"types); 2: independent rate per branch and event type; 3: random local clock"
" (rates inherited top-down, changing at each node with probability `bsr_p`)"
msgstr ""
"只用于 `method=0`；`method=1` 时 `cnets` 报错退出。0：所有分支同一速率；1：每条分支一个共享 multiplier（所有事件类型共用）；2：每条分支、每种事件类型各自独立速率；3：random "
"local clock（速率自上而下继承，每个节点以概率 `bsr_p` 改变）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--bsr_dist`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Distribution of the multipliers. 0: log-normal; 1: gamma"
msgstr "multiplier 的抽样分布。0：lognormal；1：gamma"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--bsr_variance`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0.25"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Target variance of multiplier m (E[m] = 1). Log-normal: σ = √log(1 + var), ζ"
" = −σ²/2; gamma: shape = 1/var, scale = var"
msgstr ""
"multiplier m 的目标方差（E[m] = 1）。lognormal：σ = √log(1 + var)，ζ = "
"−σ²/2；gamma：shape = 1/var，scale = var"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--bsr_p`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "(0, 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`bsr_mode=3` only: probability of a rate change at each node"
msgstr "仅 `bsr_mode=3`：每个节点发生速率改变的概率"

