msgstr "0：默认；1：debug；2：debug 并打印树的细节"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:105
msgid "Notes on `cnets` behaviour"
msgstr "`cnets` 行为说明"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:107
msgid "With `method=0` (waiting times), `model=1` is changed to `model=2`."
msgstr "`method=0`（等待时间）下，`model=1` 会被改为 `model=2`。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:108
msgid ""
"The number of erroneous sites is round(number of sites × `error_rate`), and "
"the number of sites is only set when `mode=1`. With `mode=0`, `--error_rate`"
" therefore has no effect."
msgstr ""
"加错的 site 数 = round(site 数 × `error_rate`)，而 site 数只在 `mode=1` 时赋值，所以 "
"`mode=0` 下 `--error_rate` 不生效。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:111
msgid ""
"`--stime` takes whole years only, separated by spaces. A comma or a decimal "
"point stops the reading there, and the remaining samples get wrong times "
"without a warning."
msgstr "`--stime` 只接受整数年，用空格分隔。遇到逗号或小数点时读取在那里中断，其余样本的采样时间会出错，而且没有提示。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:112
msgid "`cnets` exits if `seg_max` is smaller than the number of chromosomes."
msgstr "`seg_max` 小于染色体数时，`cnets` 直接退出。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:113
msgid ""
"`bin/run-cnets.sh` names the tree-height constraint `cons`; the `cnets` flag"
" is `--constrained`."
msgstr "`bin/run-cnets.sh` 中树高约束的变量名是 `cons`，对应的 `cnets` 参数是 `--constrained`。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:116
msgid "`cnetml` (maximum-likelihood inference)"
msgstr "`cnetml`（最大似然推断）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:118
msgid "General, input and output"
msgstr "通用 / 输入输出"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--cfile`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
