"Meta information: known number of WGDs (required if the file is given), "
"optionally per-chromosome gain/loss and per-site duplication/deletion"
msgstr "元信息：已知 WGD 次数（提供该文件时必须有），可选各染色体 gain/loss 和各 site duplication/deletion"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--nsample`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-s`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
