msgstr "输出的最大似然树；其他输出为 `<ofile>.nex`、`.nmut.nex`、`.summary.txt`、`.edge_rates.txt` 等"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--seg_file`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Write the preprocessed copy-number matrix used for tree building"
msgstr "输出预处理后用于建树的拷贝数矩阵"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:132
msgid "Run mode"
msgstr "运行模式"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0–5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"0: infer the ML tree from copy numbers; 1: test on example data; 2: "
"likelihood of a given tree with branch lengths; 3: given topology, optimise "
"branch lengths (and rates) for the maximum likelihood; 4: infer ancestral "
"states of a given tree; 5: write the segment file and exit"
msgstr ""
"0：从拷贝数推断 ML "
"树；1：在示例数据上测试；2：计算给定树（含枝长）的似然；3：给定拓扑，优化枝长（和速率）求最大似然；4：推断给定树的祖先状态；5：只生成 "
"segment 文件后退出"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--bootstrap`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Bootstrap resampling of sites (for mode 0 / 3)"
msgstr "对 site 做 bootstrap 重抽样（用于 mode 0 / 3）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:139
msgid "Model and constraints"
msgstr "演化模型与约束"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"0: Mk (deprecated); 1: one-step bounded, total (deprecated); 2: one-step "
"bounded, haplotype-specific; 3: independent Markov chains (recommended for "
"data with chromosome gain/loss and WGD)"
msgstr ""
"0：Mk（已弃用）；1：one-step bounded total（已弃用）；2：one-step bounded haplotype-"
"specific；3：independent Markov chains（数据含染色体 gain/loss 和 WGD 时推荐）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Branch-length constraint. 0: none; 1: fixed total time (constrained by age "
"and sampling times)"
msgstr "枝长约束。0：无；1：总时间固定（受年龄和采样时间约束）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--estmu`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-u`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"0: rates fixed at the input values; 1: estimate a constant mutation rate. "
"Reliable only with `constrained=1` and differing sampling times"
msgstr "0：速率固定为输入值；1：估计（常数）突变速率。需要 `constrained=1` 且样本采样时间不同才可靠"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Branch-specific rate inference. 0: constant; 1: one shared multiplier per "
"branch; 2: independent rate per branch and event type; 3: random local clock"
" (ML-RLC). Values > 0 require `model=3`; otherwise `cnetml` stops with an "
"error"
msgstr ""
"分支特异速率推断。0：常数；1：每条分支一个共享 multiplier；2：每条分支、每种事件类型各自独立速率；3：random local clock"
"（ML-RLC）。取值 > 0 时必须 `model=3`，否则 `cnetml` 报错退出"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--optim`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Optimiser. 0: Simplex; 1: L-BFGS-B"
msgstr "优化方法。0：Simplex；1：L-BFGS-B"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--cn_type`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0–4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Event types whose rates are estimated. 0: segment level only (dup/del); 1: "
"chromosome gain/loss + WGD; 2: dup/del + WGD; 3: dup/del + chromosome "
"gain/loss; 4: all. Required; `cnetml` stops with an error if it is missing"
msgstr ""
"估计哪些事件类型的速率。0：仅 segment 级（dup/del）；1：染色体 gain/loss + WGD；2：dup/del + "
"WGD；3：dup/del + 染色体 gain/loss；4：全部。必填；未传入时 `cnetml` 报错退出"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:150
msgid "Copy-number limits (rate-matrix dimensions)"
msgstr "拷贝数上限（速率矩阵维度）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Maximum copy number allowed by the bounded models"
msgstr "bounded 模型允许的最大拷贝数"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--max_wgd`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Maximum number of WGDs (WGD rate-matrix dimension, model 3)"
msgstr "允许的最大 WGD 次数（WGD 速率矩阵维度，model 3）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--max_chr_change_haplotype`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Maximum chromosome gains/losses per haplotype (model 3)"
msgstr "每个 haplotype 允许的最大染色体 gain/loss 次数（model 3）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--max_site_change_haplotype`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Maximum site duplications/deletions per haplotype (model 3). Too low gives "
"an incorrect likelihood; too high slows computation"
msgstr "每个 haplotype 允许的最大 site duplication/deletion 次数（model 3）。设得太小似然不正确，太大计算慢"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--m_max`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Maximum segment copies before chromosome-level events (currently unused; set"
" to 0 when `cn_type=2`)"
msgstr "染色体级事件之前 segment 的最大拷贝数（目前未使用；`cn_type=2` 时被置为 0）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:160
msgid "Input data type"
msgstr "输入数据类型"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--is_total`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Input is total copy number (0 = haplotype-specific)"
msgstr "输入是否为 total 拷贝数（0 = haplotype-specific）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--is_rcn`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Input is relative copy number; if 1, `cn_type` is forced to 0"
msgstr "输入是否为相对拷贝数；为 1 时 `cn_type` 被强制改为 0"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--is_bin`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Input is given per bin. 1: merge consecutive identical bins; 0: read as is"
msgstr "输入是否按 bin 给出。1：合并相邻相同的 bin；0：按原样读取"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--incl_all`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Use all input segments, including invariant sites. With `is_bin=0` and "
"`incl_all=1`, `correct_bias` is forced to 0"
msgstr "是否用全部输入 segment（含不变 site）。`is_bin=0` 且 `incl_all=1` 时 `correct_bias` 被强制改为 0"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:169
msgid "Likelihood computation"
msgstr "似然计算"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--use_repeat`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Merge repeated site patterns to speed up the likelihood"
msgstr "合并重复的 site pattern 以加速似然计算"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--correct_bias`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Apply acquisition-bias correction when invariant sites are excluded"
msgstr "排除不变 site 时做 acquisition bias 校正"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:176
msgid "Ancestral states (mode 4)"
msgstr "祖先状态（mode 4）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--infer_marginal_state`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Infer the marginal ancestral state of the MRCA"
msgstr "推断 MRCA 的边际祖先状态"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--infer_joint_state`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Infer the joint ancestral states of all internal nodes"
msgstr "推断所有内部节点的联合祖先状态"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:183
msgid "Initial trees"
msgstr "初始树"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--init_tree`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Initial tree method. 0: random coalescent tree; 1: maximum parsimony tree"
msgstr "初始树构建方法。0：随机 coalescent 树；1：最大简约树"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--dir_itrees`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Directory of user-supplied initial trees (recommended for large trees, to "
"avoid local optima)"
msgstr "用户提供的初始树所在目录（大树推荐使用，减少陷入局部最优）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Effective population size for random initial trees"
msgstr "生成随机初始树用的有效群体大小"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Generation time in years for random initial trees (differs from the `cnets` "
"default)"
msgstr "生成随机初始树用的世代时长（年），与 `cnets` 默认值不同"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Population growth rate for random initial trees"
msgstr "生成随机初始树用的群体增长率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:193
msgid "Tree search and optimisation"
msgstr "树搜索与优化"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--tree_search`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"0: genetic algorithm (slow, deprecated); 1: random-restart hill climbing (≥ "
"5 samples); 2: exhaustive search (efficient for ≤ 7 samples)"
msgstr "0：遗传算法（慢，已弃用）；1：随机重启爬山（≥ 5 个样本）；2：穷举（≤ 7 个样本时高效）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--speed_nni`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Use reduced NNI during hill climbing"
msgstr "爬山时使用简化 NNI"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--npop`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Genetic-algorithm population size, or maximum number of initial trees"
msgstr "遗传算法种群大小，或初始树最大数量"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--ngen`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-g`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "50"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Genetic-algorithm generations, or maximum perturbations/optimisations per "
"tree"
msgstr "遗传算法代数，或单棵树最大扰动/优化次数"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--nstop`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Stop after this many rounds without improvement"
msgstr "连续这么多次没有改进就停止"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--tolerance`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0.01"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Convergence tolerance of the optimiser"
msgstr "优化收敛容差"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--miter`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-m`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "2000"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Maximum optimiser iterations"
msgstr "优化最大迭代次数"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--loglh_epsilon`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Tolerance for treating two log-likelihoods as equal"
msgstr "判断两个 log likelihood 相同的容差"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--ssize`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-z`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Initial step size for GSL optimisation"
msgstr "GSL 优化的初始步长"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--scale_tobs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "1.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"Scale factor on the maximum sampling-time difference giving the lower bound "
"of root age in constrained (L-BFGS-B) optimisation"
msgstr "约束优化（L-BFGS-B）时，按最大采样时间差求根节点年龄下限的缩放因子"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:208
msgid "Mutation rates (initial or fixed values)"
msgstr "突变速率（初值或固定值）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:210
msgid ""
"Fixed values when `estmu=0`; starting values when `estmu=1` or `bsr_mode>0`."
" Units are not specified in the code."
msgstr "`estmu=0` 时为固定值，`estmu=1` 或 `bsr_mode>0` 时为初值。代码中未注明单位。"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--mu`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`-x`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0.02"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Overall mutation rate (overridden by 1 / number of sites under model 0)"
msgstr "总突变速率（model 0 下被覆盖为 1 / site 数）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Duplication rate"
msgstr "duplication 速率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Deletion rate"
msgstr "deletion 速率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--chr_gain_rate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "Chromosome gain rate"
msgstr "染色体 gain 速率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--chr_loss_rate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
