msgstr "染色体 loss 速率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--wgd_rate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "WGD rate"
msgstr "WGD 速率"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md:222
msgid "Branch-specific rates (`bsr_mode > 0`)"
msgstr "分支特异速率（`bsr_mode > 0`）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--estimate_bsr0_first`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"0: skip calibration and estimate the trunk edge's (root → MRCA) own rate "
"jointly with the per-branch multipliers/shifts; 1: calibrate the reference "
"rates with `bsr_mode=0` first, then estimate per-branch multipliers relative"
" to them"
msgstr ""
"0：不校准，把 trunk edge（root → MRCA）自身速率与各分支 multiplier/shift 联合估计；1：先按 `bsr_mode=0` "
"校准参考速率，再估计相对它的各分支 multiplier"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--rlc_search_method`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid ""
"`bsr_mode=3` only: outer search over shift edges. 0: exhaustive over all "
"subsets (small trees only); 1: stepwise greedy; 2: genetic algorithm (not "
"implemented; exits with an error)"
msgstr "仅 `bsr_mode=3`：shift edge 的外层搜索。0：穷举所有子集（仅适用于小树）；1：逐步贪心；2：遗传算法（未实现，传入即报错退出）"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`--rlc_criterion`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "`bsr_mode=3` only: model-selection criterion. 0: AIC; 1: BIC"
msgstr "仅 `bsr_mode=3`：模型选择准则。0：AIC；1：BIC"

#: ../../source/configuration/options.md
msgid "0: default; 1: debug; > 1 prints more detail on the input data"
msgstr "0：默认；1：debug；> 1 时打印更多输入数据细节"

